            <div xml:id="d717">

                <pb facs="0998" n="874" sameAs="frus:frus1923v02/pg874"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.5231/303: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Spain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Moore</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1923-11-03T13:00:00+00:00"><hi rendition="#italic">November 3,
                                1923—1 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 1:28 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>109. Spanish Government will not take up matter of our commercial treaty until
                    middle of next February because of intention to appoint a new treaty commission
                    before then. The present commission will be dismissed when it finishes the
                    negotiations now pending with Italy regarding commercial treaty.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Moore</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
